<h2>Pair it with heated or warmer accessories</h2>
<p>Cold hands and feet are often the real problem. A heated core helps, but many people get the most comfort from pairing a heated vest with <%= link_to "heated gloves", guide_path("best-heated-gloves") %>, warm socks, and hand warmers.</p>

